  "rationale": "The plant G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion actuation, exposing all controllable and uncontrollable events. The specification E1 enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear, non-obstacle states; move_forward is used for short progress; recovery from obstacles is via short directed turns, with full_rotate reserved for rare, persistent blockages. All obstacle events force a conservative turn recovery before returning to exploration. The design avoids oscillation, infinite controllable loops, and overconstraining, ensuring steady progress and reliable collision avoidance.",
